#!/command/with-contenv sh
# Uvicorn with the REST API, MCP and the event streams. Only with LEKTO_ROLE all or api: other
# roles leave it out of the bundle (scripts/stage2-hook); this guard holds for a start by hand.
role=$(printf %s "${LEKTO_ROLE:-all}" | tr '[:upper:]' '[:lower:]')
case "$role" in
  all | api) ;;
  *)
    echo "svc-api: not started with LEKTO_ROLE=$role"
    exec s6-svc -Od .
    ;;
esac
exec lekto-run lekto api
